WEBVTT

00:07:59.517 --> 00:08:04.605
My journey with Indigenous peoples
has taught me deep humility and respect.

00:08:06.315 --> 00:08:10.444
Knowing the dangers of protecting forests

00:08:10.444 --> 00:08:12.988
they persist, they put their own families,

00:08:12.988 --> 00:08:16.450
their culture, their own lives on the line

00:08:16.450 --> 00:08:20.704
in order to secure our world's chance,

00:08:20.746 --> 00:08:22.331
your chance,

00:08:22.373 --> 00:08:23.624
my chance,

00:08:24.542 --> 00:08:26.210
for a livable future.

00:08:27.002 --> 00:08:29.964
No one should have to die
protecting forests.